   "phrasing": "greet_ans_28"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Should I send a thank you email after an interview?",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 0.37,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Yes, it's a nice touch. Send it within a day, and keep it short and specific.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 1.04,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Wait a second, what do I even write in it?",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 0.75,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "kind": "wait_like",
   "phrasing": "waitlike_16",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Thank them for their time, mention one thing you enjoyed discussing, and say you're still excited about the role.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.37,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "And if I talked to three people",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 3.1,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "do I email all of them?",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 1.53,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Ideally, yes, a separate short note to each. Change a line or two so they don't look copied.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 0.56,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "What if I don't hear back in a week?",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 0.38,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then a polite follow up to the recruiter is totally fine. Just ask if there's any update on the timeline.",
